{"text":"Warmth. Ninety days of digging and crawling have torn your jacket sleeves off at the elbow. Your forearms are bare. You stuff dry fern fluff between your t-shirt and your jacket, the way birds fluff their feathers. Trapped air is warm air. Then you wrap each forearm in fluff and dark strips of t-shirt, wrist to elbow. It looks ridiculous. It works. And one morning, you stamp on the ice by the pool as hard as you can.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["W","a","r","m","t","h","."," ","N","i","n","e","t","y"," ","d","a","y","s"," ","o","f"," ","d","i","g","g","i","n","g"," ","a","n","d"," ","c","r","a","w","l","i","n","g"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","t","o","r","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","j","a","c","k","e","t"," ","s","l","e","e","v","e","s"," ","o","f","f"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","l","b","o","w","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","f","o","r","e","a","r","m","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","b","a","r","e","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","s","t","u","f","f"," ","d","r","y"," ","f","e","r","n"," ","f","l","u","f","f"," ","b","e","t","w","e","e","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","t","-","s","h","i","r","t"," ","a","n","d"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","j","a","c","k","e","t",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","b","i","r","d","s"," ","f","l","u","f","f"," ","t","h","e","i","r"," ","f","e","a","t","h","e","r","s","."," ","T","r","a","p","p","e","d"," ","a","i","r"," ","i","s"," ","w","a","r","m"," ","a","i","r","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","r","a","p"," ","e","a","c","h"," ","f","o","r","e","a","r","m"," ","i","n"," ","f","l","u","f","f"," ","a","n","d"," ","d","a","r","k"," ","s","t","r","i","p","s"," ","o","f"," ","t","-","s","h","i","r","t",","," ","w","r","i","s","t"," ","t","o"," ","e","l","b","o","w","."," ","I","t"," ","l","o","o","k","s"," ","r","i","d","i","c","u","l","o","u","s","."," ","I","t"," ","w","o","r","k","s","."," ","A","n","d"," ","o","n","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g",","," ","y